    "udt_union_v0": {
      "doc": "Storage keys. `Bill` and `Contribution` live in *persistent* storage (they\\nmust outlive the contract instance); `Admin`/`Token`/`Paused`/`Counter`\\nlive in *instance* storage so they share the instance's TTL.",
